tic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4586410/extras/8a8e78f44a5b8f7b81be6262e061fd26.webm?t=1786603081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4586410/extras/8a8e78f44a5b8f7b81be6262e061fd26.mp4?t=1786603081\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your day slowly with a quiet morning bake, or keep things moving and prepare treats as orders come in—the kitchen runs on your rhythm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4586410/extras/edb40812b736a1cbc7dd6015357c191a.avif?t=1786603081\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4586410/extras_big/edb40812b736a1cbc7dd6015357c191a.webp?t=1786603081 width=1560 height=349 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4586410/extras/6928b9976c7eedad3ce15e523e485b8a.poster.avif?t=1786603081\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4586410/extras/6928b9976c7eedad3ce15e523e485b8a.webm?t=1786603081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4586410/extras/6928b9976c7eedad3ce15e523e485b8a.mp4?t=1786603081\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn your humble kitchen into a thriving bakery with new upgrades. Shape the space into something that feels truly yours, one improvement at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_